<title>CHINA: Shanghai Haixin H1 interim up 75 perce.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Haixin H1 interim up 75 perce.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		  (millions of yuan, unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover	  363.606 vs 296.576</p>
<p>    Net profit	 45.876 vs  26.213</p>
<p>    Net asset per share 3.06 yuan   vs    3.21 yuan</p>
<p>    Earnings per share  0.27 yuan   vs    0.19 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Haixin Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: The figures were compiled under domestic accounting standards and were reported in an article carried in the China Securities newspaper on Saturday.</p>
